    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d351-a1">

                <pb facs="0466" n="358" xml:id="pg358"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No.
                    130.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lespinasse to Mr.
                            Terres.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ministry for Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Port
                                au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-11-17"><hi rendition="#italic">November 17,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vice-Consul-General</hi>:</p>
                <p>I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt of yonr dispatch of the 15th instant
                    by which you inform me that a citizen of the United States, Mr. Frederick Mevs,
                    resident of Port au Prince, has been arrested by the authorities of my
                    Government and deposited in the prison of this city.</p>
                <p>I transmit your communication to the department of justice, requesting
                    information, which I will hasten to hand you.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ed. Lespinasse.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
